    "UTF-8 / Shift_JIS の CSV に対応。ヘッダ行は date, title, amount, kind, currency, category, payer, note を認識します (日本語ヘッダもOK)。amount 列は必須、それ以外は省略可。": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unterstützt CSV in UTF-8/Shift_JIS. Die Kopfzeile erkennt date, title, amount, kind, currency, category, payer und note (auch japanische Kopfzeilen sind möglich). Die Spalte „amount“ ist erforderlich, alle anderen sind optional."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports UTF-8 / Shift_JIS CSV. The header row recognizes date, title, amount, kind, currency, category, payer, and note (Japanese headers are OK too). The amount column is required; the others are optional."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compatible con CSV en UTF-8 / Shift_JIS. La fila de encabezado reconoce date, title, amount, kind, currency, category, payer y note (los encabezados en japonés también sirven). La columna amount es obligatoria; el resto es opcional."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compatible avec les CSV UTF-8 / Shift_JIS. La ligne d'en-tête reconnaît date, title, amount, kind, currency, category, payer et note (les en-têtes en japonais sont aussi acceptés). La colonne amount est obligatoire, les autres sont facultatives."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UTF-8 / Shift_JIS CSV를 지원합니다. 헤더 행은 date, title, amount, kind, currency, category, payer, note를 인식합니다(일본어 헤더도 가능). amount 열은 필수이며 나머지는 생략 가능합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compatível com CSV em UTF-8 / Shift_JIS. A linha de cabeçalho reconhece date, title, amount, kind, currency, category, payer e note (cabeçalhos em japonês também funcionam). A coluna amount é obrigatória; as demais são opcionais."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 UTF-8 / Shift_JIS 编码的 CSV。标题行可识别 date、title、amount、kind、currency、category、payer、note（也支持日语标题）。amount 列为必填，其余可省略。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支援 UTF-8 / Shift_JIS 編碼的 CSV。標題列可辨識 date、title、amount、kind、currency、category、payer、note（也支援日文標題）。amount 欄位為必填，其餘可省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アーカイブしたシートはシート一覧の下部の「アーカイブ済み」セクションにまとまります。データは削除されず、トグルでいつでも戻せます。変更は「保存」で反映されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archivierte Blätter werden im Abschnitt „Archiviert“ unten in der Blattliste gesammelt. Die Daten werden nicht gelöscht und können jederzeit über den Schalter wiederhergestellt werden. Änderungen werden mit „Speichern“ übernommen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archived sheets are grouped in the \"Archived\" section at the bottom of the sheet list. Data is not deleted and can be restored anytime with the toggle. Changes take effect when you tap \"Save.\""
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las hojas archivadas se agrupan en la sección \"Archivadas\" al final de la lista de hojas. Los datos no se eliminan y puedes restaurarlas en cualquier momento con el interruptor. Los cambios se aplican al tocar \"Guardar\"."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les feuilles archivées sont regroupées dans la section « Archivées » en bas de la liste des feuilles. Les données ne sont pas supprimées et peuvent être restaurées à tout moment via le bouton. Les modifications prennent effet en appuyant sur « Enregistrer »."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "보관한 시트는 시트 목록 하단의 “보관됨” 섹션에 모입니다. 데이터는 삭제되지 않으며 토글로 언제든지 되돌릴 수 있습니다. 변경 사항은 “저장”을 눌러야 적용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As planilhas arquivadas ficam agrupadas na seção \"Arquivadas\", na parte inferior da lista de planilhas. Os dados não são excluídos e podem ser restaurados a qualquer momento pelo botão. As alterações são aplicadas ao tocar em \"Salvar\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已归档的账本会汇总到账本列表底部的“已归档”部分。数据不会被删除，随时可通过开关恢复。更改需点按“保存”后生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已封存的帳本會集中顯示在帳本清單下方的「已封存」區塊。資料不會被刪除，隨時可用切換開關還原。變更需點「儲存」才會生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
